The [[Dug]] [[Sebulba]] owned a massive [[Color|orange]] '''podracer''', which he used to [[Podracing|podrace]]. Sebulba was an ambitious cheater, and had secretly installed not only ion disrupters and magna spikes, but also two illegal [[flamethrower]]s in each [[engine]]. Sebulba could control the flamethrowers from his [[cockpit]], and used them to torch other [[pilot]]s.<ref name="TPM" />

